      en: ["Seat of the Bishop of Gizo", "Overlooks the turquoise sea", "Religious hub for the region", "Damaged in the 2007 earthquake"],
      es: ["Sede del obispo de Gizo", "Vista al mar turquesa", "Centro religioso de la región", "Destrucción por terremoto en 2007"],
