      en: ["Former US Navy base for Patrol Torpedo boats", "The wartime station of future US President John F. Kennedy", "Located near Tulagi in the Central Province", "Features abandoned concrete structures and equipment", "Instrumental in disrupting Japanese naval supply lines", "A primary site for World War II historical exploration"],
      es: ["Antigua base naval estadounidense para lanchas patrulleras torpederas", "Lugar de destino de John F. Kennedy (PT-109)", "Situado cerca de Tulagi, en la provincia Central", "Ruinas de estructuras de hormigón y tanques visibles en la selva", "Punto estratégico para combatir el 'Tokyo Express'", "Parte importante de los tours históricos de la SGM"],
